{"ref":"BDB, רִיחַ","hw":"רִיחַ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רִיחַ</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. denom.</strong><br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  (?), <strong>smell, perceive odour</strong>;—Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:25\" href=\"/Job.39.25\">Jb 39:25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרַח</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.19\">1 S 26:19</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫רַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:21\" href=\"/Genesis.8.21\">Gn 8:21</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרִיח֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 115:6\" href=\"/Psalms.115.6\">ψ 115:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרִיחֻ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.28\">Dt 4:28</a>, etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:38\" href=\"/Exodus.30.38\">Ex 30:38</a>, etc.;—<em>smell</em>, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:21\" href=\"/Genesis.8.21\">Gn 8:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:27\" href=\"/Genesis.27.27\">27:27</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.19\">1 S 26:19</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.28\">Dt 4:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 115:6\" href=\"/Psalms.115.6\">ψ 115:6</a>; metaph. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּהֲרִיחוֹ אֵשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:9\" href=\"/Judges.16.9\">Ju 16:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרִיחַ מִלְחָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:25\" href=\"/Job.39.25\">Jb 39:25</a> the horse <em>scenteth battle;</em> c. ב <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:38\" href=\"/Exodus.30.38\">Ex 30:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.31\">Lv 26:31</a> (both P); metaph. = <em>delight in</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:21\" href=\"/Amos.5.21\">Am 5:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.3\">Is 11:3</a> (prob. dittogr. Br<sup>MP 202</sup>).","next":"BDB, רָוַח","prev":"BDB, רֵיחַ"}